    "claim": "Dylib-authoring gotcha: a command upserted mid-session is invisible to the ALREADY-RUNNING process that authored it - Command::lookup resolves against the dylib loaded at startup, so calling a just-authored command requires a fresh process. Author first, then start the process that exercises it.",
    "tags": "phase3,gotcha",
    "confidence": "high",
    "time": 1786815200799
  },
  {
    "claim": "Running the newbound SERVER in a disposable (2026-08-16): http only comes up if runtime/<app>/app.properties exists for EVERY app in config.properties apps= (stage each from data/<lib>/_APPS/<app>/) - init_globals loads libraries and registers the boot timers (incl app:service:init which binds HTTP) from those files; missing = silent no-listener. Also set http_port to a real port (0 = disabled). At boot the server auto-logs-in admin and prints http://localhost:<port>/<app>/index.html?sessionid=... to stdout - use that session for browser automation (admin password persists in users/admin.properties). curl needs --noproxy in the container.",
    "tags": "testing",
