  {
    "claim": "Disposable-testing gotcha (cost an hour, 2026-08-17): a command upserted via dev.code in an MCP session is compiled into the dylib on disk but NOT loaded into that same process - hot reload only runs in server mode. Calling it in the same session yields No-such-command (and paths that swallow errors, like the executives catch_unwind around ask_llm, go silently dead - escalations read 0 with no error anywhere). Batteries must upsert stubs in one MCP session, kill it, and run assertions in a FRESH session.",
